      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["FCC1", "NAVC1", "HSE1", "HSE2"],
      "pins": ["FCC1.5", "FCC1.37", "FCC1.12", "FCC1.13", "NAVC1.5", "NAVC1.6"],
      "nets": ["HSE_IN_FCC", "HSE_OUT_FCC", "HSE_IN_NAVC", "HSE_OUT_NAVC", "Net-(FCC1-PH0)", "VREF+_FCC", "Net-(NAVC1-PH0)", "Net-(NAVC1-PH1)"],
      "observed": "The FCC crystal nets connect to FCC1 PE6/PE7 (pins 5/37), not its PH0/PH1 oscillator pins (pins 12/13). The NAVC crystal nets have no MCU pin nodes; NAVC1 PH0/PH1 (pins 5/6) instead connect to separate capacitor nets.",
      "expected": "Each 25 MHz HSE crystal must connect to the MCU's HSE oscillator input and output pins. The specification identifies an HSE crystal for both MCUs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"31\") (name \"HSE_IN_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"33\") (name \"HSE_OUT_FCC\") (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"37\") (pinfunction \"PE7\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"32\") (name \"HSE_IN_NAVC\") (node (ref \"C52\") (pin \"1\")) (node (ref \"HSE2\") (pin \"1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"34\") (name \"HSE_OUT_NAVC\") (node (ref \"R32\") (pin \"1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Neither MCU has its external crystal correctly connected to its HSE oscillator pins, so the intended clock source will not work and firmware operation may fail or fall back to a different clock.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomalies are present: the MCU supply pins are unconnected, the FCC VCAP pins are misused as UART signals while NAVC VCAP pins are left open, and the HSE crystals are not connected to the MCU oscillator pins."
}

